  "pages": [
    "Lily lives in a small house near the garden. She loves to plant seeds. One day, she finds a strange seed in the dirt.",
    "The seed is round and glowing. She puts it in a pot and water it carefully.",
    "The seed begins to grow, and soon it sprouts a tiny green plant. It looks like a tiny tree.",
    "As the days pass, the plant grows taller. It has leaves and a small flower that shines brightly.",
    "One morning, Lily wakes up to find the plant has grown into a beautiful tree with big leaves.",
    "The tree gives her a special gift: it grows flowers that make the sun shine brighter. Lily smiles and feels happy."
  ]
